asr-000029
00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:38.900
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: This may be a relatively modest budget compared with those of our largest departments, but the DBM carries a mandate that cuts across the entire bureaucracy.

asr-000030
00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:47.680
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Its work affects practically every department, every program, and every peso in the national budget.

asr-000031
00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:58.680
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: At the heart of its mandate is a simple principle. Every peso of public money must be properly allocated, prudently spent, transparently managed, and fully accounted for.

asr-000032
00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:07.980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: The DBM pursues this through three pillars. Fiscal discipline, effective resource allocation, and efficient government operations.

asr-000033
00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:18.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: In practical terms, government must spend within its means, put resources where they are needed the most, and continuously improve the way it operates.

asr-000034
00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:27.840
