Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That's correct, Your Honor.

asr-001165
00:59:45.120 --> 00:59:48.620
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: There are also unobligated allotments on the part of the agencies.

asr-001166
00:59:49.200 --> 00:59:51.280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And there are also unpaid obligations.

asr-001167
00:59:51.280 --> 00:59:52.480
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That's correct, Your Honor.

asr-001168
00:59:52.580 --> 00:59:53.740
