Senator Imee R. Marcos: What's the obligation figure that you have that's best updated?

asr-001745
01:16:05.600 --> 01:16:11.920
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Your Honor, we confirmed the figure 598.28 under continuing appropriations.

asr-001746
01:16:12.620 --> 01:16:15.200
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Although we would like to submit na most of these...

asr-001747
01:16:15.200 --> 01:16:20.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero yung second to the last column, kayo rin nagbigay. 30.77 lang ang obligation.

asr-001748
01:16:20.240 --> 01:16:21.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ba't hindi ninyo ginagastos?

asr-001749
01:16:21.580 --> 01:16:26.580
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That is correct, Your Honor. We reviewed the projects that are covered by these...

asr-001750
01:16:27.740 --> 01:16:38.900
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Continuing appropriations. In fact, yung iba po dito ay na-offer na doon po sa savings under the National Budget Circular 602 and 603.

asr-001751
01:16:39.140 --> 01:16:46.360
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So, kailangan lang po itong ma-update kasi yung mga negative saros po were issued after the cut-off of the reporting, Your Honor.

asr-001752
01:16:48.640 --> 01:16:50.760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nanghihinayang lang kami. Sayang yung pondo.

asr-001753
01:16:51.400 --> 01:16:55.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I-re-revert ba ito to Treasury? Nasa fourth quarter na tayo.

asr-001754
01:16:55.380 --> 01:16:57.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano bang programs and projects funded by the Treasury?

asr-001755
01:16:57.600 --> 01:17:01.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: By this continuing approach. At bakit hindi magastos?

asr-001756
01:17:02.020 --> 01:17:07.280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Your Honor, as mentioned, kami rin po nanghihinayang.

asr-001757
01:17:07.420 --> 01:17:15.200
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That's why, yun nga po, nagaya po nang nabanggit ko, in-offer po namin ito as savings para makatulong po doon sa ating uplift intervention.

asr-001758
01:17:15.200 --> 01:17:21.460
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That is also the same reason why, Your Honor, the DBM's budget is lower in 2027.

asr-001759
01:17:21.800 --> 01:17:26.600
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Dahil alam po namin na yung 2026 po namin, meron pa kaming magiging continuing.

asr-001760
01:17:26.600 --> 01:17:29.760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So we are really looking at re-priority.

asr-001761
01:17:29.960 --> 01:17:36.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano ba talaga ito? Can you give us an idea? Kagilagilalas yung hindi nagagastos yung pera, naging bato pa.

asr-001762
01:17:36.900 --> 01:17:47.200
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Meron po tayo, Your Honor, na nakitang ini-implement natin na several projects under the Public Financial Management Program of the DBM.

asr-001763
01:17:47.600 --> 01:17:53.880
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: At ito po ay kabilang sa ating mga nire-review. Na bakit nga po ba hindi ito ma-implement?

asr-001764
01:17:53.880 --> 01:17:56.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sa tinirin ninyo ang recipient nito.

asr-001765
01:17:56.600 --> 01:18:04.420
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Precisely, Your Honor. So we're also doing internal review and housekeeping in terms of our own projects, Your Honor.

asr-001766
01:18:04.840 --> 01:18:09.780
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We are checking whether kailangan po ba talaga itong mga projects na ito na maipagpatuloy.

asr-001767
01:18:09.780 --> 01:18:13.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi. Umabot na tayo ng halos November. Hindi pa nagagastos.

asr-001768
01:18:14.100 --> 01:18:21.860
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Again, Your Honor, that is precisely the reason behind us approving a lower budget for DBM for 2027.

asr-001769
01:18:21.860 --> 01:18:26.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pagkatapos sa with the Supreme Court decision, baka kasama na ito.

asr-001770
01:18:26.600 --> 01:18:29.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Talagang lalahatin ang unreleased portions.

asr-001771
01:18:30.420 --> 01:18:36.820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Isa po yun sa bahagi ng clarification na paglilino po na ating hihingin po patungkol sa desisyon, Your Honor.

asr-001772
01:18:36.900 --> 01:18:42.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay. Marami na akong tanong. Maraming salamat. Magsusunod na round na lang.

