asr-001872
01:21:18.460 --> 01:21:35.720
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Because the amount we arrived at for that particular entry, meron naman pong pinanggalingan ng mga pipeline projects. So we stand ready to help Congress in complying with that guardrail by giving the breakdown kung paano po ba namin nakuha yung support to foreign assisted projects.

asr-001873
01:21:35.720 --> 01:22:03.480
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We have also, as we have reported, listed down fewer items sa ating UA for 2027. Yun nga lang po, Mr. Chair, Mr. Senate President, there are just some items which I think is also crucial in the budget legislation phase, particularly the declaration on the unconstitutionality of one of the triggers for unprogrammed appropriations.

asr-001874
01:22:03.480 --> 01:22:24.160
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: But again, we reserve, as earlier pronounced, how this can be best interpreted and applied moving forward. But one thing we can assure is the Executive is not releasing anything as of now triggered by Sections 1A and 1B as covered by the Supreme Court decision.

asr-001875
01:22:24.720 --> 01:22:33.460
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We also welcome if Congress, as mentioned by the Supreme Court decision, will include more details or suggestions.

asr-001876
01:22:33.480 --> 01:22:48.340
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Or safeguards or requirements that will guide the Executive in further executing the unprogrammed appropriations. Maybe more parameters if necessary para po makumply natin yung four guardrails as stated by the Supreme Court.

asr-001877
01:22:48.340 --> 01:23:02.960
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Because we note that there was also a provision in the decision, a reference about approving authority. So we submit to the wisdom of Congress and the Senate as well in further defining these conditions, Your Honor.

asr-001878
01:23:03.480 --> 01:23:20.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So basically, ang sinasabi ng Supreme Court is hindi pwedeng lumampas ang Kongreso doon sa NEP proposal ng Presidente for programmed and unprogrammed.

asr-001879
01:23:20.640 --> 01:23:30.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think that's bottom line. That is one of the most important direction. And of course, nakasulat rin doon yung mga transparency.

asr-001880
01:23:32.000 --> 01:23:33.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dapat matrack mabuti.

asr-001881
01:23:33.480 --> 01:23:44.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We also engage civil society movements in the budget, which we have done in the 2026 budget. In fact, lahat yan ay uploaded sa website. And we also engage civil society organizations.

asr-001882
01:23:44.960 --> 01:23:56.360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And patuloy namin sini-engage. In fact, kahapon sa hearing ni Sen. Pangilina, nandun yung civil society organizations sharing their analysis.

asr-001883
01:23:56.840 --> 01:24:02.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So it's not only us analyzing, but we also engage third-party analysis through the civil society.

asr-001884
01:24:03.480 --> 01:24:14.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So bottom line, hindi pwedeng lumampas ang Kongreso sa proposal ng Presidente, both unprogrammed and programmed. Bottom line.

asr-001885
01:24:14.940 --> 01:24:18.820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That is how we view the decision, Your Honor.

asr-001886
01:24:19.380 --> 01:24:21.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But what is clear right now, even unprogrammed.

asr-001887
01:24:23.260 --> 01:24:24.360
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Kasama po, Your Honor.

asr-001888
01:24:24.360 --> 01:24:26.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Even unprogrammed. Kasi that was the debate.

asr-001889
01:24:27.560 --> 01:24:33.320
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Unprogrammed, hindi nga lumalampas. Pero yung unprogrammed, sobrang-sobrang na lumalampas.

asr-001890
01:24:33.480 --> 01:24:47.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For example, in 2024, ang NEP 281, unprogrammed to, 281, biglang naging 731 yung final sa unprogrammed.

asr-001891
01:24:48.020 --> 01:24:57.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In 2025, ganun rin, 158 billion yung NEP. Pagdating sa final is 363.

asr-001892
01:24:57.540 --> 01:25:02.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So it's only itong 2026 na correct. Ang proposal is 249.

asr-001893
01:25:03.480 --> 01:25:10.120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang final is 150. So bumaba sa proposal ng Presidente.

asr-001894
01:25:10.960 --> 01:25:15.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll go to some specifics because this is important in the way we will craft the budget.

asr-001895
01:25:16.440 --> 01:25:31.660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Doon sa decision ng Supreme Court, pinagbawal niya o ginawa niyang unconstitutional yung special provision 1A and 1B.

asr-001896
01:25:32.120 --> 01:25:33.360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang iniwan lang.

asr-001897
01:25:33.480 --> 01:25:42.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So ang ibig sabihin niyan, dito sa unprogrammed na gagawin for 2027, FAPS lang ang matitira.

asr-001898
01:25:45.640 --> 01:25:51.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tama? Actually, nawala na yung essence of new revenue and new taxes. Nawala na yun.

asr-001899
01:25:52.140 --> 01:26:01.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang sinasabi, the way we understand it, in fact, I'm consulting our LBRMO, the way we understand it, foreign-assisted projects na lang ang matitira.

asr-001900
01:26:01.800 --> 01:26:03.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, kanina.

asr-001901
01:26:03.480 --> 01:26:14.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sa presentation ninyo, meron pang restoration ng PDIC, merong conversion of national government agencies sa unprogrammed. Lahat yung mawawala na.

asr-001902
01:26:14.920 --> 01:26:23.100
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Mr. Chair, Your Honor, the way we understood and the way we read, again, subject to the alignment later on with the Office of the Solicitor General,

asr-001903
01:26:23.640 --> 01:26:32.020
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: meron pa naman pong possibility for that but ang sabi po sa decision, the reference is dapat yung excess is from the totality of the revenue.

asr-001904
01:26:32.020 --> 01:26:42.520
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: What was particularly covered by the decision was the reference in any one, excess in any one item po. Yun po yung reference to Section 1A.

asr-001905
01:26:42.720 --> 01:26:51.940
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So, the initial view, Your Honor, is pwede pa namang kung may excess but the excess is to be determined from the total target.

asr-001906
01:26:51.940 --> 01:27:01.940
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Yun po yung initial reading po ng team doon sa decision, subject nga po doon sa mapag-uusapan on the items to be clarified or to be respected.

asr-001907
01:27:02.020 --> 01:27:12.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But yung 1B is the totality. Diba, 1B is new revenue collection arising from taxes or non-tax.

asr-001908
01:27:13.540 --> 01:27:14.560
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: 1B is new, Your Honor.

asr-001909
01:27:14.840 --> 01:27:14.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Oo.

asr-001910
01:27:15.780 --> 01:27:18.860
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: New over and above the PSF levels.

asr-001911
01:27:18.940 --> 01:27:24.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes. Oo. So, etatlo lang naman yung sa special provision, diba?

asr-001912
01:27:24.800 --> 01:27:26.680
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That is correct. There are only three triggers.

asr-001913
01:27:26.680 --> 01:27:29.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Three triggers lang. Kung tinanggal mo yung dalawa, matitira yung foreign assistant.

asr-001914
01:27:30.180 --> 01:27:31.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In other words, the...

asr-001915
01:27:32.020 --> 01:27:34.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The unprogrammed is only designed for foreign assistant.

asr-001916
01:27:36.620 --> 01:27:42.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Now, the point I'm trying to make is we don't want to approve a budget here that is unconstitutional.

asr-001917
01:27:43.020 --> 01:27:44.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's our...

asr-001918
01:27:44.280 --> 01:27:56.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Although our legal teams here are also studying it, but we're also seeking guidance from DBM because we don't want to pass a version wherein unconstitutional siya.

asr-001919
01:27:56.640 --> 01:27:59.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For sure, tatanggalin na namin yung 1A and 1B.

asr-001920
01:28:00.440 --> 01:28:01.820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Your Honor, as for the...

asr-001921
01:28:02.020 --> 01:28:07.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: As a clarification, probably, yun nga po ang discussion ng team is the excess can still be triggered.

asr-001922
01:28:08.740 --> 01:28:12.380
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Probably, pwedeng i-correct yung base. That's an initial reading.

asr-001923
01:28:13.160 --> 01:28:16.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, mag-i-introduce ulit ng isa pang special provision.

asr-001924
01:28:19.080 --> 01:28:25.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi those are the triggers. Without those triggers, you cannot trigger the unprogrammed.

asr-001925
01:28:25.500 --> 01:28:27.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The source of the unprogrammed is new revenue.

asr-001926
01:28:28.020 --> 01:28:29.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That is correct, Your Honor.

asr-001927
01:28:29.020 --> 01:28:30.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Or excess revenue.

asr-001928
01:28:30.020 --> 01:28:31.020
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Excess revenue in any one...

asr-001929
01:28:32.020 --> 01:28:34.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Tax or non-tax.

asr-001930
01:28:34.380 --> 01:28:35.280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That is correct, Your Honor.

asr-001931
01:28:35.400 --> 01:28:45.820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We commit to work with the Senate and Congress to fine-tune the special provision for unprogrammed to make sure we will fully subscribe and follow the Supreme Court decision.

asr-001932
01:28:45.820 --> 01:28:56.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's why kanina sabi ko may clarity, mayroon rin mga questions na lumabas doon sa decisions that we want to also work with the DBM on how to do that.

asr-001933
01:28:56.920 --> 01:28:57.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001934
01:28:59.860 --> 01:29:01.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: If SP will allow us.

asr-001935
01:29:01.860 --> 01:29:01.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

asr-001936
01:29:02.020 --> 01:29:11.520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We keep talking about the unconstitutionality of 2024 and 2025 GAA, but there's also mention of 2026 nga.

asr-001937
01:29:12.060 --> 01:29:22.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, is your understanding that 2026 was also struck down as unconstitutional or merely the special provisions 1A, 1B under said chapter?

asr-001938
01:29:23.000 --> 01:29:29.560
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Your Honor, Mr. Chair, unlike 2024 and 2025, yung 2026 po wala pong specific mention that the entire GAA was declared unconstitutional.

asr-001939
01:29:29.560 --> 01:29:31.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: They didn't say it was unconstitutional.

asr-001940
01:29:32.020 --> 01:29:32.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Those two were shut down.

asr-001941
01:29:32.600 --> 01:29:36.100
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Only limited to section 1A and 1B of the UA, Your Honor.

asr-001942
01:29:36.100 --> 01:29:36.620
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Of the UA.

asr-001943
01:29:36.940 --> 01:29:37.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-001944
01:29:37.820 --> 01:29:38.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That's your understanding.

asr-001945
01:29:42.020 --> 01:29:42.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

asr-001946
01:29:42.600 --> 01:29:42.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

