02:59:59.340 --> 02:59:59.600
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: to your

asr-005468
02:59:59.600 --> 02:59:59.900
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: office.

asr-005469
03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:02.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, it doesn't have the detail that we require.

asr-005470
03:00:04.680 --> 03:00:08.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Your website doesn't have the detail that we require,

asr-005471
03:00:08.680 --> 03:00:11.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which are the amounts, the LGU, what category.

asr-005472
03:00:11.400 --> 03:00:12.380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala kasi dun eh.

asr-005473
03:00:12.460 --> 03:00:13.740
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Oh, that is in DBM Compass.

asr-005474
03:00:13.880 --> 03:00:16.980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We can guide your office, Your Honor, to generate that list.

asr-005475
03:00:17.220 --> 03:00:19.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And we will submit a separate list, Your Honor.

asr-005476
03:00:19.480 --> 03:00:23.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, I also wanted to inquire about the growth equity fund.

asr-005477
03:00:24.500 --> 03:00:28.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: It appears that the 2025 guidelines were issued only

asr-005478
03:00:28.400 --> 03:00:34.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: the year after so that it was only on February of 2026

asr-005479
03:00:34.620 --> 03:00:39.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: that the guidelines covering 2025 and 2026 were issued

asr-005480
03:00:39.100 --> 03:00:46.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: such that obligations reached 0.4% of the 2025 appropriation

asr-005481
03:00:46.700 --> 03:00:50.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and 1.5% of the 2026 appropriation.

asr-005482
03:00:51.060 --> 03:00:56.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: This fund was intended for disadvantaged LGUs

asr-005483
03:00:56.220 --> 03:00:58.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: at mas lalo silang nadi-disadvantage

asr-005484
03:00:58.400 --> 03:01:01.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: kapag napakatagal ninyo maglabas ng guideline.

asr-005485
03:01:04.200 --> 03:01:06.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kinawawa yung mga kawawang-kawawa na.

asr-005486
03:01:07.140 --> 03:01:08.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Diba, ganun ang nangyari dyan.

asr-005487
03:01:08.580 --> 03:01:11.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang requirements continue to prevent implementation

asr-005488
03:01:11.840 --> 03:01:16.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and 0.4% could not be more dismal.

asr-005489
03:01:26.520 --> 03:01:27.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: No, Secretary.

asr-005490
03:01:28.400 --> 03:01:31.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We're not trying to blame you for what happened in the past

asr-005491
03:01:31.460 --> 03:01:36.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: but you realize, of course, that there's a proposed 10.3 billion for 2027

asr-005492
03:01:36.420 --> 03:01:42.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and we don't understand now what requirements are going to be necessary

asr-005493
03:01:42.100 --> 03:01:43.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: for implementation.

asr-005494
03:01:43.660 --> 03:01:46.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Otherwise, we'll be stuck at less than 1% implementation.

asr-005495
03:01:47.920 --> 03:01:50.800
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Well, we note the observation of the good senator

asr-005496
03:01:50.800 --> 03:01:54.680
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: on the late release of guidelines for 2025 and 2026

asr-005497
03:01:54.680 --> 03:01:58.140
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: and we joined the observation that these funds are actually

asr-005498
03:01:58.140 --> 03:02:02.860
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: intended for disadvantaged LGUs who are 4th and 5th class.

asr-005499
03:02:02.960 --> 03:02:05.480
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So, what we can assure the committee is that

asr-005500
03:02:05.480 --> 03:02:09.420
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: this should not happen as well again in 2027, Your Honor,

asr-005501
03:02:09.540 --> 03:02:10.200
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: so that LGUs...

asr-005502
03:02:10.200 --> 03:02:10.980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: How to do that?

asr-005503
03:02:11.480 --> 03:02:15.200
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So that the guidelines can be issued...

asr-005504
03:02:15.200 --> 03:02:17.120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Are the guidelines already in place?

asr-005505
03:02:18.040 --> 03:02:19.540
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We have the guidelines.

asr-005506
03:02:19.640 --> 03:02:20.780
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: But these are the old ones.

asr-005507
03:02:20.900 --> 03:02:22.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Baka baguhin para sa 2027.

asr-005508
03:02:22.940 --> 03:02:24.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Mag-iintay na naman ang 2028.

asr-005509
03:02:25.140 --> 03:02:25.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pambihira naman.

asr-005510
03:02:26.260 --> 03:02:28.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: If there will be no substantial changes,

asr-005511
03:02:28.140 --> 03:02:29.840
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: and other mandates from Congress,

asr-005512
03:02:29.940 --> 03:02:30.760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: certainly, Your Honor,

asr-005513
03:02:30.860 --> 03:02:32.840
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: we can issue the guidelines as early as January.

asr-005514
03:02:33.460 --> 03:02:35.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Without power, you can hardly blame Congress.

asr-005515
03:02:36.040 --> 03:02:36.980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We will, Your Honor.

asr-005516
03:02:37.200 --> 03:02:38.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Napasa na yung batas niyan eh.

asr-005517
03:02:38.420 --> 03:02:40.520
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We assure the committee, Your Honor,

asr-005518
03:02:40.680 --> 03:02:43.140
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: that the guidelines will be released by January

asr-005519
03:02:43.140 --> 03:02:45.080
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: as soon as the GAA is passed.

asr-005520
03:02:45.280 --> 03:02:50.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: O, kasi nakakaawa itong nangyari.

asr-005521
03:02:50.600 --> 03:02:51.660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Antay sila ng antay.

asr-005522
03:02:51.780 --> 03:02:53.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sila na nga yung pinakamahirap.

asr-005523
03:02:53.220 --> 03:02:54.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Mas lalo silang kinawawa.

asr-005524
03:02:55.020 --> 03:02:56.500
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Huwag po kayong mag-alala, Your Honor,

asr-005525
03:02:56.500 --> 03:02:57.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: sa DBM.

asr-005526
03:02:57.280 --> 03:02:58.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Bawal po ang mabagal

asr-005527
03:02:58.140 --> 03:02:58.600
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: ngayon.

asr-005528
03:02:59.100 --> 03:02:59.880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sure ka, ha?

asr-005529
03:03:00.040 --> 03:03:00.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

asr-005530
03:03:00.880 --> 03:03:02.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bakit yung DBM-OSEC mismo?

asr-005531
03:03:03.640 --> 03:03:06.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Our vacancies contributing to delays

asr-005532
03:03:06.100 --> 03:03:07.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: in fund releases and oversight.

asr-005533
03:03:08.360 --> 03:03:11.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The briefer reports 465 vacancies

asr-005534
03:03:11.180 --> 03:03:14.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: out of 1,762 permanent positions

asr-005535
03:03:14.860 --> 03:03:19.560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: across DBM, OSEC, and GPP-BTSO,

asr-005536
03:03:19.820 --> 03:03:23.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which means you have a vacancy rate of 26.4%.

asr-005537
03:03:23.800 --> 03:03:26.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bakit dyan natatagalan itong guidelines at iba pa?

asr-005538
03:03:26.840 --> 03:03:30.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: How many are responsible for budget evaluation?

asr-005539
03:03:30.940 --> 03:03:33.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung tinatanong ng ating chairman

asr-005540
03:03:33.040 --> 03:03:35.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ng fund release monitoring

asr-005541
03:03:35.140 --> 03:03:36.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and what prevents these positions

asr-005542
03:03:36.960 --> 03:03:38.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: from being filled?

asr-005543
03:03:39.200 --> 03:03:44.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 26.4% is a very large unfilled proportion.

asr-005544
03:03:44.840 --> 03:03:46.220
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Kuha-kuha nyo po, Your Honor,

asr-005545
03:03:46.380 --> 03:03:47.740
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: ang aking same observation.

asr-005546
03:03:48.080 --> 03:03:51.080
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: At isa po ito sa ating talagang tinutukan.

asr-005547
03:03:51.300 --> 03:03:54.520
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We got to the bottom line of this

asr-005548
03:03:54.520 --> 03:03:55.920
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: at isa po sa naging change

asr-005549
03:03:55.920 --> 03:03:56.800
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: is meron po kasi

asr-005550
03:03:56.800 --> 03:03:59.560
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: internal HR guidelines

asr-005551
03:03:59.560 --> 03:04:01.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: that we have recently amended

asr-005552
03:04:01.180 --> 03:04:04.400
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: to facilitate us to fast-track hiring.

asr-005553
03:04:04.860 --> 03:04:06.000
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So hindi po ibig sabihin

asr-005554
03:04:06.000 --> 03:04:07.400
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: we amended the guidelines.

asr-005555
03:04:07.640 --> 03:04:09.560
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We are cutting corners

asr-005556
03:04:09.560 --> 03:04:12.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: para po makapag-hire ng hindi karapat dapat

asr-005557
03:04:12.120 --> 03:04:13.360
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: but we just eliminated

asr-005558
03:04:13.360 --> 03:04:18.420
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: probably duplicative and unnecessary processes.

asr-005559
03:04:18.860 --> 03:04:20.580
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And in fact, if I may report,

asr-005560
03:04:21.040 --> 03:04:22.400
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: over the last two months,

asr-005561
03:04:22.820 --> 03:04:24.140
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: hindi po kami tumitigil ngayon

asr-005562
03:04:24.140 --> 03:04:25.840
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: sa pag-assign ng appointments

asr-005563
03:04:25.840 --> 03:04:27.760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: at yung aming HRMPSB

asr-005564
03:04:27.760 --> 03:04:29.960
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: led by ASIC Dante De Chavez

asr-005565
03:04:29.960 --> 03:04:32.380
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: ay halos every week pong may interview

asr-005566
03:04:32.380 --> 03:04:34.420
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: just to bridge this gap on unfilled.

asr-005567
03:04:34.540 --> 03:04:35.400
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Dahil tama po kayo.

asr-005568
03:04:35.820 --> 03:04:37.060
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Yung isa pong nababakante,

asr-005569
03:04:37.180 --> 03:04:38.960
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: medyo matagal po namin napapalitan

asr-005570
03:04:38.960 --> 03:04:40.260
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: kapag may nagre-retiro,

asr-005571
03:04:40.360 --> 03:04:41.800
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: it also affects our capacity

asr-005572
03:04:41.800 --> 03:04:43.640
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: to perform our functions.

asr-005573
03:04:43.820 --> 03:04:45.280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So we assured the committee

asr-005574
03:04:45.280 --> 03:04:47.060
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: na ito pong 27%.

asr-005575
03:04:47.060 --> 03:04:49.340
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Hindi na po ito 27% ngayon.

asr-005576
03:04:49.720 --> 03:04:51.820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And we will furnish the committee

asr-005577
03:04:51.820 --> 03:04:53.020
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: with updated figures

asr-005578
03:04:53.020 --> 03:04:55.720
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: dahil ako po ay ilang linggo na pong

asr-005579
03:04:55.720 --> 03:04:56.960
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: pumipirma ng appointments

asr-005580
03:04:56.960 --> 03:04:57.720
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: just recently.

asr-005581
03:04:57.720 --> 03:04:59.760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At marami-rami na rin

asr-005582
03:04:59.760 --> 03:05:01.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ang kasama mong bata.

asr-005583
03:05:01.440 --> 03:05:03.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Otherwise, puros lola na lang kami

asr-005584
03:05:03.180 --> 03:05:04.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: kasama ng BBM.

asr-005585
03:05:04.080 --> 03:05:05.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Huwag po kayong mag-alala.

asr-005586
03:05:05.300 --> 03:05:07.240
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Mabilis po yung mga tita at tita ko

asr-005587
03:05:07.240 --> 03:05:08.020
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: na kasama ngayon.

asr-005588
03:05:08.080 --> 03:05:08.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Alright.

asr-005589
03:05:08.720 --> 03:05:09.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Thank you.

asr-005590
03:05:10.360 --> 03:05:11.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At ang BBM OSEC...

asr-005591
03:05:11.920 --> 03:05:13.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Because age doesn't matter, Your Honor.

asr-005592
03:05:14.140 --> 03:05:14.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nako, ha?

asr-005593
03:05:15.280 --> 03:05:17.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang BBM OSEC, napansin ko rin,

asr-005594
03:05:17.440 --> 03:05:19.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: nag-propose kayo ng requirements

asr-005595
03:05:19.100 --> 03:05:21.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: na BBM itself subsequently excluded.

asr-005596
03:05:22.140 --> 03:05:25.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Originally, you asked for 5.377 billion

asr-005597
03:05:25.220 --> 03:05:25.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and you applied for it.

asr-005598
03:05:25.720 --> 03:05:27.120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Appropriations for OSEC.

asr-005599
03:05:27.500 --> 03:05:29.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: But only 2.855 billion

asr-005600
03:05:29.720 --> 03:05:31.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: was approved ng sarili nyo.

asr-005601
03:05:32.120 --> 03:05:33.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala, natawa lang ako.

asr-005602
03:05:34.140 --> 03:05:36.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nearly half of your request

asr-005603
03:05:36.040 --> 03:05:38.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and then 13%

asr-005604
03:05:38.040 --> 03:05:39.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: lower pa than your

asr-005605
03:05:39.440 --> 03:05:41.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 2026, which requirements

asr-005606
03:05:41.600 --> 03:05:43.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: were excluded. And why were they proposed

asr-005607
03:05:43.680 --> 03:05:45.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: if you're not meeting your own

asr-005608
03:05:45.440 --> 03:05:46.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: criteria pala?

asr-005609
03:05:47.460 --> 03:05:49.700
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Yun po yung ginawa namin na revisiting

asr-005610
03:05:49.700 --> 03:05:51.080
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Your Honor ng aming mga

asr-005611
03:05:51.080 --> 03:05:53.280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: requirements. Yung iba po kasi dito,

asr-005612
03:05:53.280 --> 03:05:55.160
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: probably expansion ng mga

asr-005613
03:05:55.720 --> 03:05:56.960
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: subscription. So our

asr-005614
03:05:56.960 --> 03:06:00.240
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: decision is to step back and reassess

asr-005615
03:06:00.240 --> 03:06:01.980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: kung ito pang mga subscription na to

asr-005616
03:06:01.980 --> 03:06:04.220
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: ay kailangan pa at talagang

asr-005617
03:06:04.220 --> 03:06:06.260
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: nakapagbibigay sa atin ng tamang

asr-005618
03:06:06.260 --> 03:06:08.280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: tools to guide us in the budget management

asr-005619
03:06:08.280 --> 03:06:09.920
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: process. At tama po kayo,

asr-005620
