asr-005848
03:13:53.820 --> 03:13:55.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: is now actually doing is

asr-005849
03:13:55.140 --> 03:13:56.620
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: back to its basic mandate.

asr-005850
