Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: very extreme lang po, talagang

asr-005852
03:14:01.160 --> 03:14:03.080
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: subject to, they even require

asr-005853
03:14:03.080 --> 03:14:05.160
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: my clearance if they will need to

asr-005854
03:14:05.160 --> 03:14:07.140
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: accept other

asr-005855
03:14:07.140 --> 03:14:09.240
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: activities for them

asr-005856
03:14:09.240 --> 03:14:11.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: to act as procuring agents. So, very

asr-005857
03:14:11.180 --> 03:14:13.360
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: seldom na po nilang ginagawa yan ngayon.

asr-005858
03:14:13.780 --> 03:14:15.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi, nagbumibili pa

asr-005859
03:14:15.420 --> 03:14:16.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ng fire trucks eh.

asr-005859-split-2
03:14:16.560 --> 03:14:17.280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That is correct.

asr-005860
03:14:17.440 --> 03:14:18.410
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, wala nang ganon?

asr-005860-split-2
03:14:18.410 --> 03:14:19.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Wala po ngayon.

asr-005861
03:14:19.360 --> 03:14:21.080
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: They were even engaged, Your Honor,

asr-005862
03:14:21.160 --> 03:14:22.520
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: as procurement agent.

asr-005863
03:14:22.520 --> 03:14:24.460
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: When I was still in DOTR,

asr-005864
03:14:25.140 --> 03:14:27.360
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: also a time. So, ngayon po, talagang

asr-005865
03:14:27.360 --> 03:14:29.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: dahil ang pinagtutuunan po natin

asr-005866
03:14:29.180 --> 03:14:31.220
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: ng attention is do what they do

asr-005867
03:14:31.220 --> 03:14:33.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: best, meaning procuring common

asr-005868
03:14:33.120 --> 03:14:35.220
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: use supply. Dahil even until now, we're

asr-005869
03:14:35.220 --> 03:14:37.240
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: looking at stock availability.

asr-005870
03:14:37.660 --> 03:14:39.240
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So, dahil with the new mandate

asr-005871
03:14:39.240 --> 03:14:41.040
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: of the New Government Procurement Act,

asr-005872
03:14:41.180 --> 03:14:43.240
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: hindi lang po national government agencies

asr-005873
03:14:43.240 --> 03:14:45.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: ang required na ngayong bumili sa

asr-005874
03:14:45.180 --> 03:14:47.160
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: PS, so even local government units,

asr-005875
03:14:47.300 --> 03:14:49.220
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: state universities, and colleges.

asr-005876
03:14:49.540 --> 03:14:51.080
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So, tinututukan po natin yung

asr-005877
03:14:51.080 --> 03:14:53.220
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: stock availability. That leads me

asr-005878
03:14:53.220 --> 03:14:54.480
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: to the benefit, Your Honor.

asr-005879
03:14:55.140 --> 03:14:56.620
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Kaya naman po binuo ang PS

asr-005880
03:14:56.620 --> 03:14:58.880
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: because of the economies of scale for

asr-005881
03:14:58.880 --> 03:14:59.760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: common use supply.

asr-005882
03:15:00.000 --> 03:15:18.200
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That if we are able to buy in bulk, we can get prices at a much lower competitive price. At doon naman po talaga nakikita yung benefit ng PS. We're looking at a difference of about 20-30% ng market price for our common use supplies.

asr-005883
03:15:18.200 --> 03:15:28.980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And right now with e-marketplace, categorized na rin po sa nabibili sa PS, even our motor vehicles, even our email subscription.

asr-005884
03:15:29.460 --> 03:15:38.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So we can now negotiate much lower prices from our fulfillers dahil nga po we can guarantee the procurement for the entire bureaucracy.

asr-005885
03:15:39.860 --> 03:15:43.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Magkano ang savings ngayon na de-generate for common use supplies?

asr-005886
03:15:45.460 --> 03:15:46.720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: On the average lang.

asr-005887
03:15:46.720 --> 03:15:58.820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: I just have the figures about 20-30% on the average but on the nominal, maybe I would ask ED Gen your honor to provide the figures.

asr-005888
03:15:59.000 --> 03:16:05.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi before nga alam ko na nagiging ano siya, yung procuring agent ng iba-ibang ahensya.

asr-005889
03:16:05.300 --> 03:16:08.000
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Right now your honor, hindi na po siya pwedeng gawing parking lot.

asr-005890
03:16:08.000 --> 03:16:15.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: O yan, kasi isa pa yan. Para mapakita nila na obligated na, nagagamit na yung pondo.

asr-005891
03:16:16.260 --> 03:16:16.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pinaparking.

asr-005892
03:16:16.720 --> 03:16:22.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pinaparking nila dyan or doon sa Philippine International Trading Corporation, PITC.

asr-005893
03:16:22.460 --> 03:16:28.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So yan, dalawang paborito ng mga agencies to window dress their financials.

asr-005894
03:16:29.000 --> 03:16:36.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So okay, it's good to hear. At least nakaka-save tayo ng 20% or more or so.

asr-005895
03:16:38.020 --> 03:16:42.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: My next question, Secretary, will be on the NTA.

asr-005896
03:16:43.640 --> 03:16:46.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Malaki ang NTA natin, 1.3 trillion.

asr-005897
03:16:46.720 --> 03:16:53.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 1.3 trillion out of the 7.2 trillion, so almost a seventh na sa NTA.

asr-005898
03:16:54.100 --> 03:16:56.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And suspended pa rin yung devolution, diba?

asr-005899
03:16:57.980 --> 03:17:04.340
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We have released, your honor, the president has issued EO 103, resuming the process of full devolution.

asr-005900
03:17:04.600 --> 03:17:07.400
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Under the EO po, the transition period is extended.

asr-005901
03:17:08.140 --> 03:17:12.940
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: 2027 for provinces and cities.

asr-005902
03:17:14.220 --> 03:17:15.760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: 2028 for... No, no.

asr-005903
03:17:15.760 --> 03:17:20.500
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: 2027 for cities, 2028 for provinces and municipalities, your honor.

asr-005904
03:17:20.580 --> 03:17:29.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay. And ano yung mga... Can you give us just a very, ano lang, snapshot of what items will be devolved?

asr-005905
03:17:30.400 --> 03:17:38.760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So during the last meeting of the Committee on Devolution, the sentiment, Mr. Senate President, was...

asr-005906
03:17:38.760 --> 03:17:45.720
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Because initially, there's an expanded list apart from what was identified in the local government code.

asr-005907
03:17:45.760 --> 03:17:52.480
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So the IRR now actually gives priority first on what was explicitly mentioned under the local government code.

asr-005908
03:17:52.480 --> 03:18:00.860
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And then yung Annex B ngayon, yun po yung mga pwede pa on top of the LGU, but subject to the capacity of the local government unit concerned.

asr-005909
03:18:01.000 --> 03:18:12.120
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So we're looking at going back again to other devolved functions like AGRI, highlighting as well their role on school buildings, local roads, among others.

asr-005910
03:18:12.400 --> 03:18:15.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So ano yung mga nasa expanded list? Can you give us...

asr-005911
03:18:15.760 --> 03:18:16.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Just a snapshot.

asr-005912
03:18:18.520 --> 03:18:20.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung nasa local government code, given na yan eh.

asr-005913
03:18:21.180 --> 03:18:26.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Alam na ni Senator, ni Chairman at Senator JV yan dahil nag-mayor kami.

asr-005914
03:18:26.840 --> 03:18:28.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But yung expanded list.

asr-005915
03:18:28.900 --> 03:18:33.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And the reason why I'm asking, because every year tataas itong NTA natin eh.

asr-005916
03:18:33.660 --> 03:18:34.160
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Yes, your honor.

asr-005917
03:18:34.180 --> 03:18:38.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And to our total budget, it's about a seventh already.

asr-005918
03:18:38.920 --> 03:18:43.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So malaki talaga ang binibigay natin sa local government.

asr-005919
03:18:43.440 --> 03:18:44.920
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So example, your honor, of the suggested...

asr-005920
03:18:45.760 --> 03:18:47.740
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Ito yung mga nasa Annex B.

asr-005921
03:18:48.000 --> 03:18:54.180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So this would include mini hydroelectric projects for provinces and cities,

asr-005922
03:18:54.900 --> 03:18:59.000
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: inter-municipal telecommunication services for provinces,

asr-005923
03:19:00.120 --> 03:19:05.460
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: transportation facilities for provinces, cities, and municipalities,

asr-005924
03:19:06.140 --> 03:19:07.380
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: tourism facilities.

asr-005925
03:19:08.940 --> 03:19:14.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Alam mo, Secretary, ako I suggest, we should give, we should devolve functions that are...

asr-005926
03:19:15.760 --> 03:19:21.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: directly, that is directly felt by our constituents.

asr-005927
03:19:22.720 --> 03:19:24.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll give you a case in point.

asr-005928
03:19:24.340 --> 03:19:26.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But this needs a law and some further study.

asr-005929
03:19:27.240 --> 03:19:27.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Fire.

asr-005930
03:19:28.600 --> 03:19:28.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Di ba?

asr-005931
03:19:30.140 --> 03:19:32.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang traffic enforcers, local government.

asr-005932
03:19:33.240 --> 03:19:33.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Di ba?

asr-005933
03:19:34.000 --> 03:19:38.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang building inspectors, local government.

asr-005934
03:19:39.700 --> 03:19:43.040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ako nakikita ko, fire, pwede i-devolve yan.

asr-005935
03:19:43.700 --> 03:19:45.600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because it responds directly to...

asr-005936
03:19:45.760 --> 03:19:46.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: the local government needs.

asr-005937
03:19:47.080 --> 03:19:49.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I know it needs a law, kasi may sariling law yan.

asr-005938
03:19:49.360 --> 03:19:51.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But these are things that we can study.

asr-005939
03:19:52.960 --> 03:19:58.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, because, in fact, kagaya kami sa Valenzuela,

asr-005940
03:19:58.280 --> 03:19:59.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ang bumibili ng fire truck kami.

asr-005941
03:20:00.800 --> 03:20:03.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's not the BFP because of lack of funds.

asr-005942
03:20:04.140 --> 03:20:06.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang BFP nilang naiiwan sa kanila yung tao.

asr-005943
03:20:06.240 --> 03:20:11.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But in terms of services felt by our constituents,

asr-005944
03:20:12.060 --> 03:20:13.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: especially kung may sunog,

asr-005945
03:20:14.060 --> 03:20:15.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: pag nagkakasunog,

asr-005946
03:20:15.360 --> 03:20:15.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ang tinatawag,

asr-005947
03:20:15.760 --> 03:20:16.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: tinatawagan naman, mayor.

asr-005948
03:20:17.380 --> 03:20:19.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, these are the things that we can study,

asr-005949
03:20:20.040 --> 03:20:21.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: that we can devolve.

asr-005950
03:20:22.280 --> 03:20:23.940
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Actually, isa rin po pala siya, your honor,

asr-005951
03:20:24.040 --> 03:20:25.980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: sa suggested items, sa Annex B.

asr-005952
03:20:26.260 --> 03:20:27.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ako, kung ako mayor,

asr-005953
03:20:27.620 --> 03:20:30.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I would embrace that

asr-005954
03:20:30.160 --> 03:20:32.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: para talagang pagdating sa serbisyo,

asr-005955
03:20:33.400 --> 03:20:34.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: isa na lang yung kausap.

asr-005956
03:20:34.440 --> 03:20:35.380
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Anyway, your honor,

asr-005957
03:20:35.560 --> 03:20:38.260
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: in the lens of optimization,

asr-005958
03:20:38.520 --> 03:20:41.020
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: tama rin po kayo na even fire gets a share

asr-005959
03:20:41.020 --> 03:20:43.160
